      {
        "id": "E3",
        "kind": "body",
        "text": "In this post, we deploy Kokoro-82M , an 82-million-parameter TTS model, as a custom container on an Amazon SageMaker AI real-time endpoint.",
        "sourceUrl": "https://aws.amazon.com/blogs/machine-learning/stop-guessing-auto-scaling-targets-for-tts-on-amazon-sagemaker-ai/",
        "source": "AWS Machine Learning Blog",
        "publishedAt": "2026-10-22T16:30:06.000Z",
        "checkedAt": "2026-10-24T00:33:43.415Z"
      },
      {
        "id": "E4",
        "kind": "body",
        "text": "Most public guidance on Amazon SageMaker AI auto scaling targets short synchronous request/response calls, or large language model (LLM) serving, where the natural metric is tokens generated per second.",
        "sourceUrl": "https://aws.amazon.com/blogs/machine-learning/stop-guessing-auto-scaling-targets-for-tts-on-amazon-sagemaker-ai/",
